    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Craft Magic Armor to Enhance Your Abilities</p></blockquote><p>An Armorer modifies armor until it works almost like a second skin, honing its magic to unleash powerful attacks and raise a formidable defense.</p><h3>Armorer Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.WLbaTbz88gUtEYH6]{Tools of the Trade}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bDGJXEeUMqZ8eVel]{Arcane Armor}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.4TLmfS5GwraJAxqD]{Armor Model}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.zMeqGKGECHHojc8a]{Extra Attack}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.4NTiI8Yzra6YqXBz]{Improved Armorer}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jypMZj7h3pleCZSk]{Perfected Armor}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Armorer Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Artificer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMagicMissi]{Magic Missile}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplThunderwav]{Thunderwave}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMirrorImag]{Mirror Image}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShatter000]{Shatter}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHypnoticPa]{Hypnotic Pattern}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLightningB]{Lightning Bolt}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFireShield]{Fire Shield}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterInv]{Greater Invisibility}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPasswall00]{Passwall}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWallofForc]{Wall of Force}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
